#: manifest.json
msgid "Chat with your chosen model; let AI write Vestra plugins: check, test, install (reversible), export (BYOK, experimental)"
msgstr "和你选的模型对话，让 AI 写 Vestra 插件：检查、测试、安装（可回退）、导出（自带 API key，实验性）"

#: manifest.json
msgid ""
"Vestra Player AI is the AI assistant inside the player, based on pi (github.com/earendil-works/pi). Choose a provider in the settings (Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, OpenRouter, DeepSeek, or an OpenAI-compatible service such as Ollama) and save your own API key to start a conversation.\n"
"\n"
"Each conversation has its own folder; the AI can only read and write that folder and cannot run commands. The API key is kept only in the system keychain, never in a file. The cost of calling the model is charged to your provider account.\n"
"\n"
"The AI writes plugins from the plugin SDK's documentation and fixes its own errors with the type check, tests and packing tools; a finished plugin can be installed (reversibly) or exported as a .vxp or as a complete source project."
msgstr ""
"Vestra Player AI 是播放器里的 AI 助手，基于 pi（github.com/earendil-works/pi）。在设置里选择服务商（Anthropic、OpenAI、Google、OpenRouter、DeepSeek，或 Ollama 等 OpenAI 兼容服务）并保存你自己的 API key，就可以开始对话。\n"
"\n"
"每个对话有自己的文件夹，AI 只能读写这个文件夹，不能运行命令。API key 只保存在系统钥匙串里，不写入任何文件。调用模型的费用由你的服务商账户承担。\n"
"\n"
"AI 按插件 SDK 的文档写插件，用类型检查、测试和打包工具自己修错；写好的插件可以安装（能回退），也可以导出 .vxp 或完整的源码项目。"

